IPVdLCWo6NgZBho1Zt5DfPVAbp7E6XCvyP79_gq00M-K0g2kTWgsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQslsjDHMPAp6TRUHUE3tUlkVpKjHdJdARISqdGJp4MqQ&oe=6AFC7840"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SGVRTrailerCover.png", "id": "1489970458990826", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1489970465657492_5101885299613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=33U-fCHIg-gQ7kNvwH4_9__&_nc_oc=AdoR4b-LYnIcs4b0IZz3S5KEFv8_JW_FnzKtlmxsZWNKDUP_Q1av-RjDuDKfh3SlIEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRyBViKyDWOhT7I4YzCVkAqY1mt1Gz7foCSuZlf92s82Q&oe=6AFC735D"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_descript